$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM (3R,4R)-3-Methyl-4-[(R)-4-methyl-3-oxo-7-(4,4,5,5-tetramethyl-[1,3,2]dioxaborolan-2-yl)-2,3,4,10-tetrahydro-9-oxa-1,2,4a-triaza-phenanthren-6-yl]-piperidine-1-carboxylic
acid tert-butyl ester. A mixture of
(3R,4R)-4-((R)-7-bromo-4-methyl-3-oxo-2,3,4,10-tetrahydro-9-oxa-1,2,4a-triaza-phenanthren-6-yl)-3-methyl-piperidine-1-carboxylic
acid tert-butyl ester (intermediate obtained at Step G during preparation
of compound 17a, 0.150 g, 0.304 mmol),
4,4,5,5,4',4',5',5'-octamethyl-[2,2']bi[[1,3,2]dioxaborolanyl] (0.232 g,
0.912 mmol), PdCl2(dppf)-CH2Cl2 (0.044 g, 0.061 mmol) and KOAc (0.090 g,
0.912 mmol) in EtOH (5 mL) was heated at 90 °C for 16 h. The reaction was
cooled to ambient temperature. The solvent was removed in vacuo and the
residue was purified by prep-TLC (eluting with 50% EtOAc in petroleum
ether).
(3R,4R)-3-methyl-4-[(R)-4-methyl-3-oxo-7-(4,4,5,5-tetramethyl-[1,3,2]dioxaborolan-2-yl)-2,3
,4,10-tetrahydro-9-oxa-1,2,4a-triaza-phenanthren-6-yl]-piperidine-1-carboxylic
acid tert-butyl ester (0.090 g, 55%) as a pale solid. LC/MS (Table 1,
Method 7) Rt = 0.967 min; MS m/z: 563 [M+Na]+.
